      `,highlight:"#sidebar, #mobile-menu-btn",waitForClick:"#sidebar, #mobile-menu-btn"},{stepId:"action_area",title:"\u{1F3D8}\uFE0F \u4F60\u5728\u57CE\u4E2D\u6751\uFF0C\u8FD9\u662F\u4F60\u7684\u8D77\u70B9",body:`
